# NLAP Mandatory QA Gate

## Before any release or EXE build

1. `python scripts/run_mandatory_qa.py --manifest-check`
2. `python scripts/run_mandatory_qa.py`
3. `python -m pytest tests/ -q`
4. `python _prebuild.py`

## After any code change (features, bug fixes, refactors)

1. Read `.cursor/skills/nlap-release-council/SKILL.md`
2. If behavior changed: add `@pytest.mark.mandatory` tests in `tests/mandatory/`
3. Update `qa/mandatory/MANIFEST.yaml` scenario entries
4. Extend `.cursor/skills/nlap-release-council/QUESTIONNAIRE.md` rows

## Council personas (all code-backed)

Network council · Architect · Software engineer · Field operator · Product simplicity (Steve Jobs lens) · UI/UX professional

## Do not ship when

- Mandatory manifest out of sync
- P0 gaps open in latest gap register
- New feature without mandatory test coverage

